00:35:19.565 --> 00:35:20.690
a group of data scientists.

00:35:20.690 --> 00:35:21.356
They can create.

00:35:21.356 --> 00:35:22.280
They can do a lot.

00:35:22.280 --> 00:35:24.500
Now, business people, you
give access to large data

00:35:24.500 --> 00:35:28.670
sets and finding
answers on the problems

00:35:28.670 --> 00:35:30.800
you see over a rise
